#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:2
msgid "状态看板与指令"
msgstr "Status Dashboard and Instructions"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:8
msgid "状态看板"
msgstr "Status Dashboard"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:9
msgid ""
"状态看板是一个默认随着插件开机自启动的controller，名称为fairino_hardware_state_broadcaster。它通过hardware_states话题发布机器人及硬件状态，通过dexhand_states话题发布灵巧手状态。"
msgstr ""
"The status dashboard is a controller that starts automatically by default "
"when the plugin is turned on, named fairino_hardware_state_broadcaster. It "
"publishes the robot and hardware status through the hardware_states topic, "
"and the dexterous hand status through the dexhand_states topic."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:11
msgid ""
"hardware_states的消息类型为hardware_state_broadcaster_msgs/msg/HardwareState，默认发布频率为50Hz；dexhand_states的消息类型为hardware_state_broadcaster_msgs/msg/DexhandState，默认发布频率跟随hardware_states。发布频率可以通过配置文件设置。"
msgstr ""
"hardware_states's message type is "
"hardware_state_broadcaster_msgs/msg/HardwareState, the default publishing "
"frequency is 50Hz; dexhand_states's message type is "
"hardware_state_broadcaster_msgs/msg/DexhandState, the default publishing "
"frequency follows hardware_states. The publishing frequency can be set "
"through the configuration file."

