#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:116
msgid "joint_fault_tolerant_state"
msgstr "joint_fault_tolerant_state"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:118
msgid ""
"关节通信容错状态。数组顺序与joint_names对应，0表示无通信故障，1表示关节驱动器EtherCAT通信故障。不包含末端板、分支器等非关节从站。"
msgstr ""
"Joint communication fault tolerance status. The array order corresponds to "
"joint_names, 0 indicates no communication fault, 1 indicates joint driver "
"EtherCAT communication fault. Does not include end plates, splitters, and "
"other non-joint slaves."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:120
msgid "slaves_state"
msgstr "slaves_state"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:122
msgid ""
"EtherCAT从站工作状态。按照配置中的从站顺序排列，包含关节和其他从站。0表示正常，1表示从站掉线，2表示非OP状态或AL状态异常，4表示Error"
msgstr ""
"EtherCATSlave working status. According to the order of slaves in the "
"configuration, including joints and other slaves. 0indicates normal, "
"1indicates slave offline, 2indicates non-OPstatus or ALstatus abnormal, "
"4indicates Error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:124
msgid "end_device_fault_state"
msgstr "end_device_fault_state"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:125
msgid "uint16[2]"
msgstr "uint16[2]"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:126
msgid "左右末端设备异常状态。数组下标0对应左末端，下标1对应右末端，单末端使用下标0。0表示无已上报异常，非0时按位解析，多个异常可以同时存在。"
msgstr ""
"Abnormal status of left and right end devices. The array index 0 corresponds"
" to the left end, the index 1 corresponds to the right end, and a single end"
" uses the index 0. 0 indicates no reported anomalies; when not 0, parse by "
"bit, multiple anomalies can exist simultaneously."

