#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:284
msgid ""
"其中，hexerrorcode_curerrcode是当前系统的错误码，一旦该数值为非0，说明系统存在错误，由于错误码显示使用了十进制，而编写错误码采用了十六进制，因此需要讲十进制数据转换成十六进制数，才能解析出错误码对应的故障信息，以下是32位错误码组成说明。"
msgstr ""
"Here, “hexerrorcode_curerrcode” is the current system error code. If this "
"value is non-zero, it indicates that an error exists in the system. Since "
"the displayed error code uses decimal notation while the error codes are "
"defined in hexadecimal, the decimal value must be converted to hexadecimal "
"to interpret the corresponding fault information. Below is an explanation of"
" the 32-bit error code structure."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:287
msgid "表2-2 插件32位错误码组成说明表"
msgstr "Table 2-2: Description of 32-bit Plugin Error Codes"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:293
msgid "**字节位置**"
msgstr "**Byte Position**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:294
msgid "**名称**"
msgstr "**Name**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:295
msgid "**取值及含义**"
msgstr "**Values and Their Meanings**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:297
msgid "[31:24] 字节4"
msgstr "[31:24] Byte 4"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:298
msgid "Severity (故障等级)"
msgstr "Severity"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x00 = OK (正常)"
msgstr "0x00 = OK (Normal)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x01 = INFO (提示信息)"
msgstr "0x01 = INFO (informational message)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x02 = WARN (一般警告，不阻断运行)"
msgstr "0x02 = WARN (General warning, does not interrupt execution)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x0E = ERROR (运行故障，打断运动)"
msgstr "0x0E = ERROR (Operation failure, motion interruption)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x0F = FATAL (致命故障，触发急停与安全锁)"
msgstr "0x0F = FATAL (Fatal fault, triggering emergency stop and safety lock)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:305
msgid "[23:16] 字节3"
msgstr "[23:16] Byte 3"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:306
msgid "Subsystem (子系统模块)"
msgstr "Subsystem"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x00 = INIT (初始化过程)"
msgstr "0x00 = INIT (initialization process)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x10 = RUN (运行过程)"
msgstr "0x10 = RUN (Running Process)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x20 = SENSOR (传感器)"
msgstr "0x20 = SENSOR"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst
msgid "0x30 = HAL (硬件抽象层反馈)"
msgstr "0x30 = HAL (Hardware Abstraction Layer Feedback)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:312
msgid "[15:08] 字节2"
msgstr "[15:08] Byte 2"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:313
msgid "MainCode (主错误码)"
msgstr "MainCode (Main Error Code)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:314
msgid "例如：0x00, 0x01, 0xFF (全局广播)"
msgstr "For example: 0x00, 0x01, 0xFF (global broadcast)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:316
msgid "[07:00] 字节1"
msgstr "[07:00] Byte 1"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:317
msgid "SubCode (从错误码)"
msgstr "Subcode (from error code)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:318
msgid "流水号，用于精确区分具体的报错原因"
msgstr ""
"Serial number, used to precisely distinguish the specific cause of an error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:321
msgid ""
"请注意，目前规定致命级别的错误不支持错误恢复，错误级别的均可以通过指令服务器的reseterror指令恢复，警告级别的信息会通过curwarncode提示但是不会中断系统运行。"
msgstr ""
"Note that fatal-level errors currently do not support error recovery; all "
"error-level issues can be recovered via the server’s “reseterror” command; "
"warning-level messages are indicated by “curwarncode” but do not interrupt "
"system operation."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:324
msgid "表2-3 致命(FATAL)级别故障码"
msgstr "Table 2-3 Fatal-Level Fault Codes"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:330
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:392
