#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:417
msgid "**排查与处理方向**"
msgstr "**Troubleshooting and Resolution Guidelines**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:334
msgid "0x0F000001"
msgstr "0x0F000001"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:335
msgid "参数读取异常，非法参数"
msgstr "Parameter reading exception, invalid parameter"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:336
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:340
msgid "启动之前是否自行修改过配置文件，或者配置文件是否损坏，建议重新运行frconfig指令，使用法奥给的配置文件进行从站配置"
