#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:342
msgid "0x0F000004"
msgstr "0x0F000004"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:343
msgid "初始化共享内存或者信号量打开失败"
msgstr "Failed to initialize shared memory or open semaphore"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:344
msgid "HAL库没有正确启动，请联系法奥技术人员排查"
msgstr ""
"The HAL library failed to initialize properly. Please contact FAO technical "
"support for troubleshooting."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:346
msgid "0x0F000008"
msgstr "0x0F000008"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:347
msgid "读取初始状态和校验错误"
msgstr "Reading initial state and checksum error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:348
msgid "调用的HAL库版本不对，请使用法奥提供的升级包进行升级后重启"
msgstr ""
"The invoked HAL library version is incorrect. Please upgrade using the Faao-"
"provided update package and then restart."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:350
msgid "0x0F000010"
msgstr "0x0F000010"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:351
msgid "读取初始状态从站信息校验错误,检查ethercat拓扑结构"
msgstr ""
"Error reading initial slave status information; check the EtherCAT topology."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:352
msgid "从站数量和类型校验错误，请检查当前加载的配置是否和真实硬件对应并且确认开机的时候EtherCAT线是接在控制器上的"
msgstr ""
"Error in verifying the number and type of slave stations. Please check "
"whether the currently loaded configuration matches the actual hardware and "
"confirm that the EtherCAT cable is connected to the controller at power-on."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:354
msgid "0x0F000020"
msgstr "0x0F000020"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:355
msgid "读取初始状态共享内存对象为空错误"
msgstr "Error: Reading initial state shared memory object is empty"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:356
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:360
msgid "HAL库退出，请联系法奥技术人员排查"
msgstr ""
"HAL library exited. Please contact Faou technical support for "
"troubleshooting."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:358
msgid "0x0F000040"
msgstr "0x0F000040"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:359
msgid "读取初始状态超时"
msgstr "Timeout reading initial state"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:362
msgid "0x0F100001"
msgstr "0x0F100001"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:363
msgid "共享内存看门狗超时"
msgstr "Shared Memory Watchdog Timeout"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:364
msgid "HAL 库掉线或底层驱动进程死掉。排查底层 igh 进程是否正常存活，检查 IPC 共享内存机制是否被阻塞。"
msgstr ""
"The HAL library has gone offline or the underlying driver process has "
"crashed. Check whether the underlying igh process is running normally and "
"verify whether the IPC shared memory mechanism is blocked."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:366
msgid "0x0F100101"
msgstr "0x0F100101"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:367
msgid "从站信息和校验错误"
msgstr "Slave Information and Checksum Errors"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:368
msgid "底层获取的伺服数据包 CRC 校验失败。重点检查总线网线是否松动、水晶头是否良好，或线缆是否受到强电磁干扰。"
msgstr ""
"CRC verification failure for the servo data packet obtained at the lower "
"layer. Pay special attention to whether the bus network cable is loose, "
"whether the RJ-45 connector is intact, or whether the cable is subject to "
"strong electromagnetic interference."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:370
msgid "0x0F100102"
msgstr "0x0F100102"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:371
msgid "从站数量或类型异常"
msgstr "Abnormal number or type of slave stations"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:372
msgid "实际扫描到的物理关节数量/型号，与 YAML 配置文件定义的拓扑结构不一致。检查配置文件加载是否正确。"
msgstr ""
"The actual number/model of physically scanned joints is inconsistent with "
"the topology defined in the YAML configuration file. Check whether the "
"configuration file is loaded correctly."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:374
msgid "0x0F100103"
msgstr "0x0F100103"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:375
msgid "状态共享内存指针为空"
msgstr "Status shared memory pointer is null"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:376
msgid "内存映射失败。ROS 2 hardware_interface 无法正确挂载读取机械臂状态的共享内存地址。"
msgstr ""
"Memory mapping failed. The ROS 2 hardware_interface failed to correctly "
"mount the shared memory address for reading the robotic arm’s status."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:378
msgid "0x0F100201"
msgstr "0x0F100201"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:379
msgid "指令共享内存指针为空"
msgstr "Instruction shared memory pointer is null"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:380
msgid "内存映射失败。ROS 2 hardware_interface 无法正确挂载下发运动指令的共享内存地址。"
msgstr ""
"Memory mapping failed. The ROS 2 hardware_interface cannot correctly mount "
"the shared memory address for issuing motion commands."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:383
msgid ""
"请注意，在系统刚启动的时候，解析出来的错误码可能在以上表格中找不到，比如会出现0x0F00005，这个错误码是0x0F00001和0x0F00004的组合，因为在系统初始化的时候，进行一系列的操作均可能出现错误，但是系统没启动之前，这些错误无法立即给出，只能采用叠加累计的方式，因此会在初始化后出现这种组合错误码。"
msgstr ""
"Note that immediately after system startup, the parsed error codes may not "
"be found in the table above—for example, 0x0F00005 may appear. This error "
"code is a combination of 0x0F00001 and 0x0F00004, because multiple "
"operations during system initialization may each fail; however, before the "
"system fully starts up, these errors cannot be reported immediately and are "
"instead accumulated cumulatively, resulting in such composite error codes "
"appearing after initialization."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:386
msgid "表2-4 错误(ERROR)级别错误码"
msgstr "Table 2-4 ERROR-Level Error Codes"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:396
msgid "0x0E10FF01"
msgstr "0x0E10FF01"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:397
msgid "驱动器故障 (全局广播)"
msgstr "Drive Failure (Global Broadcast)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:398
msgid "0xFF 代表任意轴的广播报警。电机可能发生了过流、过载、碰撞导致过力矩，或编码器掉线。需结合单轴 errorcode 进一步定位具体关节。"
msgstr ""
"0xFF indicates a broadcast alarm for any axis. Possible causes include "
"overcurrent, overload, excessive torque due to collision, or encoder "
"disconnection. Refer to the individual-axis error code to pinpoint the "
"specific joint."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:400
msgid "0x0E100001"
msgstr "0x0E100001"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:401
msgid "软急停触发"
msgstr "Soft Emergency Stop Triggered"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:402
msgid "逻辑急停被拍下。上位机或示教器下发了紧急停止指令，底层立刻中断当前运动队列以保障安全。"
msgstr ""
"Logical emergency stop triggered. The host computer or teach pendant issued "
"an emergency stop command, causing the underlying system to immediately "
"interrupt the current motion queue to ensure safety."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:404
msgid "0x0E100002"
msgstr "0x0E100002"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:405
msgid "指令队列长度过长"
msgstr "Instruction queue is too long"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:406
msgid "插补缓冲区溢出。上位机下发轨迹点位过密或控制频率过高，导致底层消费者处理超时。需检查控制器执行频率设置。"
msgstr ""
"Interpolation buffer overflow. The host computer sends trajectory points too"
" densely or sets the control frequency too high, causing timeout in the "
"underlying consumer processing. Please check the controller’s execution "
"frequency setting."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:409
msgid "表2-5 警告(WARN)级别错误码"
msgstr "Table 2-5 Warning (WARN)-Level Error Codes"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:416
msgid "**警告释义**"
msgstr "**Warning Interpretation**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:419
msgid "0x02100001"
msgstr "0x02100001"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:420
msgid "指令步进较大 (触发削峰)"
msgstr "Large instruction step (triggering clipping)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:421
msgid "规划器下发的相邻两点位置差值超过了底层的最大速度/加速度限制，底层强制进行了削峰平滑。可能会导致实际轨迹与预期有极小偏差。"
msgstr ""
"The positional difference between two consecutive points issued by the "
"planner exceeds the underlying system’s maximum velocity/acceleration "
"limits, triggering forced peak clipping and smoothing. This may cause a "
"negligible deviation between the actual and intended trajectory."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:423
msgid "0x02100002"
msgstr "0x02100002"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:424
msgid "指令队列写入失败"
msgstr "Instruction queue write failure"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:425
msgid "瞬时并发过高，导致系统在极短瞬间无法将插补点推入无锁队列，可能引起短暂的运动卡顿。"
msgstr ""
"Excessively high instantaneous concurrency causes the system to fail to push"
" interpolation points into the lock-free queue within an extremely short "
"time, potentially resulting in brief motion stuttering."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:427
msgid "0x02100004"
msgstr "0x02100004"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:428
msgid "末端设备异常"
msgstr "End device abnormal"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:429
msgid "左右末端至少一侧反馈异常。"
msgstr "At least one side of the left and right ends feeds back abnormally."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:431
msgid ""
"灵巧手状态通过dexhand_states话题独立发布。该话题反馈左右灵巧手的激活状态、设备ID、当前指令号、电机数量及运动完成情况，同时反馈每个电机的位置、速度、力矩和错误码。该功能需要对应机型具备配套末端接口并完成灵巧手配置。"
msgstr ""
"Dexterous hand status is published independently through the dexhand_states "
"topic. This topic provides feedback on the activation status, device ID, "
"current command number, number of motors, and motion completion for both "
"left and right dexterous hands, while also providing feedback on the "
"position, speed, torque, and error codes for each motor. This function "
"requires that the corresponding model be equipped with a compatible end "
"interface and that the dexterous hand configuration is completed."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:433
msgid "具体的msg定义如下表所示："
msgstr "具体的msg definition is as shown in the following table:"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:446
msgid "消息头，包含状态数据的时间戳。"
msgstr "Message header, containing the timestamp of status data."

