msgstr "interfacedexhands1_curtor"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:478
msgid "左臂灵巧手各电机的当前力矩，单位为百分比。"
msgstr ""
"The current torque of each motor in the left arm dexterous hand, in "
"percentage."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:480
msgid "interfacedexhands1_done"
msgstr "interfacedexhands1_done"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:482
msgid "左臂灵巧手各电机的运动完成标志，1表示完成，0表示未完成。"
msgstr ""
"The completion flag for the movement of each motor in the left arm dexterous"
" hand, 1 indicates completion, 0 indicates not completed."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:484
msgid "interfacedexhands1_error"
msgstr "interfacedexhands1_error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:486
msgid "左臂灵巧手各电机的错误码。0，无故障；1，RS-485通信超时；2，设备指令错误；3，工件掉落；4，末端异常。"
msgstr ""
"Error codes for each motor of the dexterous hand on the left arm. 0, no "
"fault; 1, RS-485 communication timeout; 2, device command error; 3, "
"workpiece drop; 4, end abnormality."

