msgstr ""
"The current torque of each motor in the dexterous hand of the right arm, "
"unit is percentage."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:520
msgid "interfacedexhands2_done"
msgstr "interfacedexhands2_done"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:522
msgid "右臂灵巧手各电机的运动完成标志，1表示完成，0表示未完成。"
msgstr ""
"The completion flag for the movement of each motor in the dexterous hand on "
"the right arm, 1 indicates completion, 0 indicates not completed."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:524
msgid "interfacedexhands2_error"
msgstr "interfacedexhands2_error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:526
msgid "右臂灵巧手各电机的错误码。0，无故障；1，RS-485通信超时；2，设备指令错误；3，工件掉落；4，末端异常。"
msgstr ""
"Error codes for each motor of the dexterous hand on the right arm. 0, no "
"fault; 1, RS-485 communication timeout; 2, device command error; 3, "
"workpiece drop; 4, end abnormality."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:528
msgid ""
"以上电机数组按照电机编号从小到大排列，下标0对应1号电机。数组长度根据对应灵巧手反馈的slavenum确定，最多支持16个电机；数量无效时数组为空。这里的16表示接口容量，实际支持的电机数量以所连接的灵巧手为准。"
msgstr ""
"The above motor array is arranged in ascending order of motor numbers, with "
"the index 0 corresponding to the 1 motor. The length of the array is "
"determined by the slavenum fed back by the corresponding dexterous hand, "
"supporting up to 16 motors; if the quantity is invalid, the array is empty. "
"Here, 16 represents the interface capacity, and the actual number of "
"supported motors is subject to the dexterous hand connected."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:530
msgid ""
"movedone表示整只灵巧手的运动完成情况，done数组表示各电机分别是否完成。判断一条指令的执行结果时，应同时结合cmdnum、完成标志和错误码。"
msgstr ""
"movedone indicates the completion status of the entire dexterous hand, done "
"array indicates whether each motor has completed its task. When judging the "
"execution result of an instruction, one should consider both cmdnum, the "
"completion flag, and the error code."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:533
msgid "指令服务器"
msgstr "Command Server"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:534
msgid ""
"指令服务器是随着插件系统默认开机自启动的一个controller，名称是fairino_hardware_command_controller，它对外提供了一个名称为command的action服务器，其自定义交互消息格式为："
msgstr ""
"The instruction server is a controller that starts automatically with the "
"plugin system upon boot-up, named “fairino_hardware_command_controller.” It "
"provides an action server externally named “command,” using a custom "
"interaction message format:"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:537
msgid "表2-6 自定义交互消息格式"
msgstr "Table 2-6 Custom Interactive Message Format"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:543
msgid "string command"
msgstr "string command"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:544
msgid "Request (Goal) - 字符串指令，例如 \"Enable(1)\""
msgstr "Request (Goal) – String command, e.g., \"Enable(1)\""

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:546
msgid "string error_code"
msgstr "string error_code"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:547
msgid "Result - 控制器专属 16位 Hex 错误码，例如 \"0xC000\""
msgstr ""
"Result – Controller-specific 16-bit hexadecimal error code, e.g., \"0xC000\""

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:549
msgid "float32 progress"
msgstr "float32 progress"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:550
msgid "Feedback - 执行进度 (0.0 ~ 100.0)"
msgstr "Feedback – Execution Progress (0.0 ~ 100.0)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:553
msgid "表2-7 目前支持的指令表"
msgstr "Table 2-7 Supported Instructions"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:559
msgid "**指令名称**"
msgstr "**Instruction Name**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:560
msgid "**功能深度描述**"
msgstr "**In-depth Feature Description**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:561
msgid "**输入参数说明**"
msgstr "**Input Parameter Description**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:563
msgid "activatecontroller"
msgstr "activateController"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:564
msgid ""
"激活指定的 ROS 2 控制器。通过调用 controller_manager 的服务，将目标控制器状态从 inactive 切换为 active。"
msgstr ""
"Activate the specified ROS 2 controller by calling the controller_manager "
"service to transition the target controller’s state from inactive to active."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:565
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:569
msgid "args[0]: 控制器名称 (String)示例: fairino_trajectory_controller"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: Controller name (String) Example: fairino_trajectory_controller"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:567
msgid "deactivatecontroller"
msgstr "Deactivate controller"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:568
msgid "停用指定的 ROS 2 控制器。将正在运行的控制器状态切换为 inactive，常用于控制权交接（如切出轨迹控制，切入阻抗控制）。"
msgstr ""
"Deactivate the specified ROS 2 controller. Switch the running controller’s "
"state to inactive, commonly used for control authority handover (e.g., "
"switching out trajectory control and switching in impedance control)."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:571
msgid "enable"
msgstr "enable"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:572
msgid "机器人使能 (Servo ON)。向下位机发送指令，闭合继电器，给各关节伺服电机上电并开启力矩输出。"
msgstr ""
"Robot Enable (Servo ON). Send a command to the lower-level controller to "
"close the relay, power up the joint servo motors, and enable torque output."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:573
msgid "无参数的情况下是全部关节使能，有参数的情况按照Bit位使能(比如1是第一关节，2是第二关节，4是第三关节，8是第四关节，7是一二三关节)"
msgstr ""
"When no parameters are provided, all joints are enabled; when parameters are"
" provided, joints are enabled according to bit positions (e.g., 1 enables "
"joint 1, 2 enables joint 2, 4 enables joint 3, 8 enables joint 4, and 7 "
"enables joints 1, 2, and 3)."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:575
msgid "disable"
msgstr "disable"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:576
msgid "机器人下使能 (Servo OFF)。切断伺服电机力矩输出，机械臂进入抱闸（Brake）状态。"
msgstr ""
"Robot servo disable (Servo OFF). Cuts off torque output from the servo "
"motors, causing the robotic arm to engage the brake."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:577
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:625
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:629
msgid "同enable函数用法"
msgstr "Same usage as the enable function"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:579
msgid "setdo"
msgstr "setdo"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:580
msgid "设置数字输出 (Digital Output)。控制机器人控制柜或末端工具的 IO 针脚电平，用于触发外围设备（如夹爪、焊枪、继电器）。"
msgstr ""
"Configure digital output to control the IO pin levels of the robot control "
"cabinet or end-effector, enabling activation of peripheral devices (e.g., "
"grippers, welding torches, relays)."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:581
msgid "args[0]: IO 端口索引/名称args[1]: 状态 (\"1\"/\"true\" 开, \"0\"/\"false\" 关)"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: IO port index/name  \n"
"args[1]: Status (\"1\"/\"true\" for on, \"0\"/\"false\" for off)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:583
msgid "zeroing"
msgstr "zeroing"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:584
msgid "执行机械臂零点标定。触发底层寻零逻辑，使关节自动寻找机械原点并重置绝对编码器偏置。"
msgstr ""
"Perform zero-point calibration of the robotic arm. Trigger the underlying "
"homing logic to enable joints to automatically locate the mechanical origin "
"and reset the absolute encoder offset."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:585
msgid "同enable用法"
msgstr "Same usage as enable"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:587
msgid "reseterror"
msgstr "reset error"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:588
msgid "错误复位。当底层触发 ERROR 报警导致抱闸后，如果物理故障已解除，调用此指令清除底层错误标志，使系统恢复待机状态。"
msgstr ""
"Error reset. When the underlying system triggers an ERROR alarm causing "
"brake engagement, invoking this command clears the underlying error flag and"
" restores the system to standby mode, provided the physical fault has been "
"resolved."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:589
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:613
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:617
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:621
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:637
msgid "无参数"
msgstr "No parameters"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:591
msgid "frconfig"
msgstr "frconfig"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:592
msgid ""
"动态生成机器人的核心配置文件。拉起后台 Python 脚本，解析 YAML 配置，动态生成 URDF 模型和 controller_manager "
"配置文件。"
msgstr ""
"Dynamically generate the robot’s core configuration files. Launch the "
"background Python script to parse the YAML configuration and dynamically "
"generate the URDF model and controller_manager configuration files."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:593
msgid ""
"args[0] (可选): /opt/fairino_art_plugin/config文件夹下配置文件名。若为空，默认使用 "
"\"fairino_config.yaml\"，等同于frconfig(fairino_config.yaml)"
msgstr ""
"args[0] (optional): The configuration file name under the "
"`/opt/fairino_art_plugin/config` directory. If omitted, the default file "
"`\"fairino_config.yaml\"` is used, equivalent to "
"`frconfig(fairino_config.yaml)`."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:595
msgid "upgradeplugin"
msgstr "upgrade plugin"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:596
msgid "自动升级底层驱动与插件包。解压传入的 zip 包，清理旧环境，将新代码覆盖至 /opt 系统目录，并自动修复 .sh 及可执行文件的权限。"
msgstr ""
"Automatically upgrade underlying drivers and plugin packages. Extract the "
"incoming ZIP package, clean up the old environment, overwrite the new code "
"to the /opt system directory, and automatically fix permissions for .sh and "
"executable files."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:597
msgid "args[0]: 升级包 .zip 的绝对路径。示例: [\"/tmp/update_v2.zip\"]"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: The absolute path of the upgrade package (.zip). Example: "
"[\"/tmp/update_v2.zip\"]"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:599
msgid "packlog"
msgstr "PackLog"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:600
msgid ""
"一键打包系统日志与 Dump 故障快照。将 /home/fairino/plugin_log/ "
"下的故障快照及系统运行日志压缩成一个归档文件，方便现场人员拷贝导出。"
msgstr ""
"One-click packaging of system logs and dump snapshots. Compresses fault "
"snapshots and system runtime logs from /home/fairino/plugin_log/ into a "
"single archive file for easy copying and export by on-site personnel."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:601
msgid "无参数 (或可选传入目标导出路径)"
msgstr "No parameters (or optionally specify the target export path)"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:603
msgid "recorddata"
msgstr "record data"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:604
msgid "控制用户高频数据录制器。在内存中开启/关闭 20MB 的循环数据录制队列，用于抓取高精度的关节位置、力矩及状态波形。"
msgstr ""
"Control the user’s high-frequency data recorder. Enable or disable a 20 MB "
"circular data recording queue in memory for capturing high-precision joint "
"position, torque, and status waveforms."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:605
msgid "args[0]: 动作指令。仅接受 \"start\" 或 \"stop\" (忽略大小写)。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: Action command. Only \"start\" or \"stop\" is accepted (case-"
"insensitive)."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:607
msgid "switchmode"
msgstr "switch mode"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:608
msgid "切换伺服控制模式，注意，关节伺服有位置模式和扭矩模式，模块化伺服有位置模式和速度模式，指定序号的伺服如果参数和允许的模式不适配会返回错误"
msgstr ""
"Switch the servo control mode. Note that joint servos support position and "
"torque modes, while modular servos support position and speed modes. If the "
"parameters of the specified servo do not match the allowed modes, an error "
"will be returned."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:609
msgid ""
"args[0]:模式名称,position为位置模式，velocity为速度模式，torque为扭矩模式，args[1]:从站mask掩码，按照bit位为1的从站序号去切换模式"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: Mode name; “position” for position mode, “velocity” for velocity mode, “torque” for torque mode.  \n"
"args[1]: Slave mask; switches modes for slaves whose indices correspond to the bit positions set to 1 in the mask."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:611
msgid "reboot"
msgstr "reboot"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:612
msgid "重启指令"
msgstr "Restart command"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:615
msgid "shutdownsys"
msgstr "shutdownsys"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:616
msgid "关机指令"
msgstr "Power-off command"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:619
msgid "getecatcommstatus"
msgstr "getecatcommstatus"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:620
msgid "获取ethercat通讯信息，用于辅助诊断ethercat通讯状态"
msgstr ""
"Obtain ethercat communication information, used to assist in diagnosing "
"ethercat communication status"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:623
msgid "enablevelff"
msgstr "enablevelff"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:624
msgid "开启指定速度前馈（默认关闭）,插件根据位置指令差分计算速度前馈并下发给电机，用于减小位置跟踪延迟。仅在位置控制模式下生效。"
msgstr ""
"Enable the specified velocity feedforward（disabled by default）,plugin "
"calculates the velocity feedforward by differentiating the position command "
"and sends it to the motor，to reduce the position tracking delay。It is only "
"effective in position control mode。"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:627
msgid "disablevelff"
msgstr "disablevelff"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:628
msgid "关闭机器人速度前馈功能"
msgstr "Disable robot velocity feedforward function"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:631
msgid "sdosetforcesensorzero"
msgstr "sdosetforcesensorzero"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:632
msgid "末端六维力清零"
msgstr "Zero the end-effector six-dimensional force"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:633
msgid "args[0]:ethercat从站id，args[1]:末端位置，当单臂的1，双臂左臂为1，右臂为2。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]:ethercat slave station id, args[1]: end position, when it is a "
"single arm, it is 1, for dual arms, the left arm is 1, and the right arm is "
"2."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:635
msgid "sdogetslaveporterrcounter"
msgstr "sdogetslaveporterrcounter"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:636
msgid "获取各关节EtherCAT端口的错误计数，用于辅助排查总线通信异常。"
msgstr ""
"Obtain the error count of each joint's EtherCAT port, used to assist in "
"troubleshooting bus communication anomalies."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:639
msgid "sdosetdexteroushandsact"
msgstr "sdosetdexteroushandsact"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:640
msgid "设置指定末端灵巧手的激活或复位状态。"
msgstr "Set the activation or reset status of the specified end effector."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:641
msgid ""
"args[0]：从站id；args[1]：末端位置，1为左侧、2为右侧，单末端使用1；args[2]：灵巧手设备id；args[3]：激活标志，取0或1。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: from station id; args[1]: end position, 1 for left, 2 for right, "
"use 1 for single end; args[2]: dexterous hand device id; args[3]: activation"
" flag, take 0 or 1."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:643
msgid "sdosetcleardexteroushandserror"
msgstr "sdosetcleardexteroushandserror"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:644
msgid "清除指定末端灵巧手的故障。"
msgstr "Clear the fault of the specified end dexterous hand."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:645
msgid "args[0]：从站id；args[1]：末端位置，1为左侧、2为右侧，单末端使用1。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: from station id; args[1]: end position, 1 is on the left, 2 is on "
"the right, for a single end use 1."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:647
msgid "enabletorqueff"
msgstr "enabletorqueff"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:648
msgid "开启指定关节的位置模式力矩前馈，可同时修改并保存所选关节的前馈系数。"
msgstr ""
"Enable the position mode torque feedforward of the specified joint, which "
"allows modifying and saving the feedforward coefficient of the selected "
"joint at the same time."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:649
msgid "args[0]：可选关节掩码，不填或填0表示全部关节。其后可依次填写所选关节的系数，顺序按照关节编号从小到大排列；不填写系数时使用现有系数。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: Optional joint mask, leaving it blank or filling in 0 indicates all"
" joints. The coefficients for the selected joints can be filled in "
"sequentially afterwards, arranged in ascending order according to the joint "
"numbers; if no coefficient is filled in, the existing coefficient is used."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:651
msgid "disabletorqueff"
msgstr "disabletorqueff"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:652
msgid "关闭指定关节的位置模式力矩前馈。"
msgstr ""
"Turn off the position mode torque feedforward for the specified joint."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:653
#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:657
msgid "args[0]：可选关节掩码，不填或填0表示全部关节。"
msgstr ""
"args[0]: Optional joint mask, not filling or filling 0 indicates all joints."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:655
msgid "gettorqueffgain"
msgstr "gettorqueffgain"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:656
msgid "查询指定关节当前使用的力矩前馈系数，返回关节名称及对应系数。"
msgstr ""
"Query the torque feedforward coefficient currently used by the specified "
"joint, return the joint name and the corresponding coefficient."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:659
msgid ""
"同样的，根据上面阐述的指令服务器交互信息格式，每个一string指令都会有一个string反馈值，这个返回值是16位的错误码系统，其具体函数见如下表格："
msgstr ""
"Similarly, according to the instruction-server interaction format described "
"above, each string instruction has a corresponding string feedback value—a "
"16-bit error code system, whose specific functions are detailed in the table"
" below:"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:662
msgid "表2-8 具体函数表"
msgstr "Table 2-8 Specific Function Table"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:668
msgid "**返回值**"
msgstr "**Return Value**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:669
msgid "**触发场景释义**"
msgstr "**Trigger Scenario Definition**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:670
msgid "**常见排查与处理建议**"
msgstr "**Common Troubleshooting and Resolution Recommendations**"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:672
msgid "\"0xC000\""
msgstr "0xC000"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:673
msgid "执行成功。指令完整拉起并顺利结束。"
msgstr ""
"Execution succeeded. The command was fully launched and completed "
"successfully."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:674
msgid "无需处理，上位机可继续下发后续流程。"
msgstr ""
"No action required; the host computer can continue issuing subsequent "
"procedures."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:676
msgid "\"0xC010\""
msgstr "0xC010"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:677
msgid "参数非法或防注入拦截。传入参数为空，或包含危险 Shell 字符。"
msgstr ""
"Invalid parameter or injection prevention intercepted. The input parameter "
"is empty or contains dangerous shell characters."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:678
msgid "检查上位机下发的参数，确保仅包含合法文件路径或纯文本。"
msgstr ""
"Check the parameters sent by the host computer to ensure they contain only "
"valid file paths or plain text."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:680
msgid "\"0xC011\""
msgstr "0xC011"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:681
msgid "依赖服务不可用。试图调用的 ROS 2 内部服务（如 controller_manager）掉线或未就绪。"
msgstr ""
"Dependent service is unavailable. The ROS 2 internal service being called "
"(e.g., controller_manager) is offline or not ready."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:682
msgid "检查目标节点是否存活，或等待系统完全启动后再下发指令。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the target node is alive, or wait until the system has fully "
"booted before issuing commands."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:684
msgid "\"0xC012\""
msgstr "0xC012"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:685
msgid "硬件状态异常。在下发需要硬件配合的指令时，检测到底层处于报错或未使能状态。"
msgstr ""
"Hardware status is abnormal. An error or disabled state was detected at the "
"underlying level when issuing commands requiring hardware cooperation."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:686
msgid "请先查阅 fairino_hardware 的硬件报警码，复位硬件后再试。"
msgstr ""
"Please first check the hardware alarm codes for fairino_hardware, then reset"
" the hardware and try again."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:688
msgid "\"0xC013\""
msgstr "0xC013"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:689
msgid "指令超时。指令在规定时间内未完成（如下载、系统响应等）。"
msgstr ""
"Command timeout. The command did not complete within the specified time "
"(e.g., download, system response, etc.)."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:690
msgid "检查网络连接或系统负载是否过高。"
msgstr "Check the network connection or whether the system load is too high."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:692
msgid "\"0xC020\""
msgstr "0xC020"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:693
msgid "控制器切换失败。软切换（如从关节空间切换到笛卡尔空间 Controller）被系统拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"Controller switching failed. The soft switch (e.g., from joint space to "
"Cartesian space controller) was rejected by the system."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:694
msgid "检查控制器名称是否拼写正确，或控制器端口占用冲突"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the controller name is spelled correctly, or whether there is "
"a port conflict on the controller."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:696
msgid "\"0xC021\""
msgstr "0xC021"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:697
msgid "校零超时。"
msgstr "Zero calibration timeout."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:698
msgid "检查插件是否正常运行中"
msgstr "Checking if the plugin is running normally"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:700
msgid "\"0xC030\""
msgstr "0xC030"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:701
msgid "配置生成失败。Python 脚本解析 YAML 或生成 URDF/控制器配置失败。"
msgstr ""
"Configuration generation failed. The Python script failed to parse the YAML "
"or generate the URDF/controller configuration."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:702
msgid "检查 YAML 格式是否正确，文件是否人为篡改或者出现乱码"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the YAML format is correct, and whether the file has been "
"manually tampered with or contains garbled characters."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:704
msgid "\"0xC040\""
msgstr "0xC040"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:705
msgid "解压升级包失败。unzip 指令返回非零退出码。"
msgstr ""
"Failed to extract the upgrade package. The unzip command returned a non-zero"
" exit code."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:706
msgid "检查 .zip 文件路径是否正确、压缩包是否损坏或 /tmp 空间是否满。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the .zip file path is correct, whether the archive is "
"corrupted, or whether the /tmp space is full."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:708
msgid "\"0xC041\""
msgstr "0xC041"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:709
msgid "目录覆盖失败。插件升级覆盖到 /opt/... 目录时出错。"
msgstr ""
"Directory overwrite failed. An error occurred while the plugin upgrade "
"attempted to overwrite the /opt/... directory."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:710
msgid "检查目录的权限归属（属主是否为 fairino）或是否被占用。"
msgstr ""
"Check the directory permissions and ownership (whether the owner is fairino)"
" or whether it is occupied."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:712
msgid "\"0xC050\""
msgstr "0xC050"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:713
msgid "打包日志失败。收集、压缩 Dump 文件及系统运行日志时报错。"
msgstr ""
"Failed to package logs. An error occurred while collecting and compressing "
"dump files and system runtime logs."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:714
msgid "检查目标存储路径权限及磁盘剩余容量。"
msgstr ""
"Check the permissions of the target storage path and the remaining disk "
"capacity."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:716
msgid "\"0xC060\""
msgstr "0xC060"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:717
msgid "数据记录操作失败。recorddata(start/stop) 指令处理失败或写入异常。"
msgstr ""
"Data recording operation failed. The recorddata(start/stop) command "
"processing failed or a write exception occurred."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:718
msgid "检查 /tmp/record_data 目录是否可写，或内存中是否存在死锁。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the /tmp/record_data directory is writable, or whether a "
"deadlock exists in memory."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:720
msgid "\"0xC0FE\""
msgstr "0xC0FE"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:721
msgid "未知指令。上位机发送了一个 Action Server 无法解析的命令字。"
msgstr ""
"Unknown command. The host computer sent a command that the Action Server "
"cannot parse."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:722
msgid "对齐上位机与下位机的通信协议接口文档。"
msgstr ""
"Alignment of the communication protocol interface documentation between the "
"host computer and the slave computer."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:724
msgid "\"0xC0FF\""
msgstr "0xC0FF"

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:725
msgid "底层抛出异常。C++ 或脚本内部发生未捕获的严重崩溃/被系统强杀。"
msgstr ""
"An exception was thrown at the lower level. A severe crash occurred inside "
"C++ or a script, or the process was forcibly terminated by the system."

#: ../../source/PluginManual/plugin_board.rst:726
msgid "需查看宿主机 dmesg 或节点标准输出，排查段错误（Segfault）或依赖丢失。"
msgstr ""
"Check the host’s dmesg or the node’s standard output to troubleshoot "
"segmentation faults (segfaults) or missing dependencies."

